>> Slurp := Ahanoa hou.

Slurp ina-tae: ['hou'] mahia: {
	ake str := [''].
}.


Slurp ina-tae: ['whakautu:'] mahia: { :blah
		(ake str = ['']) pono: {
			ake str tāpiri-muri: blah.
		}, ki-te-kore: {
			ake str tāpiri-muri: [' '].
			ake str tāpiri-muri: blah.
		}.
}.

Slurp ina-tae: ['whakautu:a:'] mahia: { :blah :blahah
		ake str tāpiri-muri: (blah mai: 0 roa: (blah roa - 1)).
		ake str tāpiri-muri: [' '].
		ake str tāpiri-muri: blahah.
}.

Slurp ina-tae: ['obtain'] mahia: {
	>> buffer := ake str.
	ake str := ['']. <- buffer.
}.


Slurp hou hello world.
Huaputa tuhi: (Slurp obtain), rārangi-hou. 
Huaputa tuhi: (Slurp obtain), rārangi-hou. 
Slurp hello world.
>> x := Slurp hou.
Huaputa tuhi: (x obtain), rārangi-hou. 
x hi there.
Huaputa tuhi: (x obtain), rārangi-hou. 
